[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13201.79, "timestamp": "03:40:01", "text": "呃，目前这种情况不会持续很长时间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13204.79, "timestamp": "03:40:04", "text": "是的，因为我得照顾家人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13207.99, "timestamp": "03:40:07", "text": "因为我的大部分，几乎所有的部分"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13209.99, "timestamp": "03:40:09", "text": "就像所有家庭成员都是六个人一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13212.63, "timestamp": "03:40:12", "text": "所以我就得照顾他们，而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13214.91, "timestamp": "03:40:14", "text": "和他们在一起时，我喜欢帮助他们走路。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13217.63, "timestamp": "03:40:17", "text": "一切都很正常，确实有点痛苦。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13220.15, "timestamp": "03:40:20", "text": "被打断等等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13223.83, "timestamp": "03:40:23", "text": "总是这样，或者如果我能像呃 ke 那样做的话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13226.229, "timestamp": "03:40:26", "text": "但这一次，必须竖起一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13229.269, "timestamp": "03:40:29", "text": "很多BBS，而且需要一段时间才能出现"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13231.389, "timestamp": "03:40:31", "text": "回去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13234.79, "timestamp": "03:40:34", "text": "嗯，我会试着搬家，我会试试。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13238.229, "timestamp": "03:40:38", "text": "我将直播频道迁移到 YouTube 和 Twitch。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13240.55, "timestamp": "03:40:40", "text": "比如早上和下午的P或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13243.63, "timestamp": "03:40:43", "text": "未来我会尝试一些新的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13246.269, "timestamp": "03:40:46", "text": "嗨"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13248.87, "timestamp": "03:40:48", "text": "总之，今天就到这里吧，希望你们喜欢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13252.91, "timestamp": "03:40:52", "text": "一直很享受，呃，你管这叫什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13255.75, "timestamp": "03:40:55", "text": "直到那时，我为什么说直到那时？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13258.349, "timestamp": "03:40:58", "text": "对，如果你感兴趣的话。"}]